<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Friday in the Philippine Basketball Association Third Conference tournament, which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 99-93 (43-45)</p>
<p>Purefoods Hotdog beat Santa Lucia Realty 96-79 (48-45)</p>
</text>
